{% import '_includes/forms' as forms %}

<p class="light">
    {{ 'Paying on terms is an authorisation, not a payment: completing checkout records an **authorised** transaction, the order completes, and `totalPaid` stays at zero — which is true, because nobody has paid yet. Capture the transaction when the money arrives and Commerce marks the order paid with its own machinery.'|t('forklift')|md }}
</p>

<p class="light">
    {{ 'This gateway offers itself only to a company account that is set up for terms, is not on hold, and would not go past its credit limit. A customer over their limit is not refused checkout — they simply pay another way.'|t('forklift') }}
</p>

{{ forms.selectField({
    label: 'Payment type'|t('commerce'),
